com/user-attachments/assets/f9c68066-6cf8-4892-81d9-5a73b8a613f9\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nmake a GPU particle 2D with collision enabled, and an occluder node with SDF enabled, and then have a camera which you rotate. When rotating the camera, particle collisions break.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109888/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}